    "urlText": "L1 Fish Market lift out of service",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-52083",
    "content": "<div>\n<div>The lift at the Fish Market light rail stop on the L1 Dulwich Hill Line is temporarily out of service until further notice.</div>\n<div>For your safety, do not use even if doors open.</div>\n<div>Alternative access:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Use the stairs, if able to</li>\n<li>Or use the opposite accessible entry/exit ramp via Bank Street.</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>For urgent assistance:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Use the Help Point if on the platform</li>\n<li>Or call 131 500</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
