      "speechText": "The lift at the Fish Market light rail stop on the L1 Dulwich Hill Line is temporarily out of service until further notice.\nFor your safety, do not use even if doors open. If able, there is alternative access via the stairs or the opposite accessible entry/exit ramp via Bank Street. For urgent assistance, use the Help Point if on the platform or call 131 500.",
